WEBVTT

00:12.603 --> 00:14.737
<i>Finally, we can talk...</i>

00:15.403 --> 00:16.403
<i>Higan.</i>

00:17.470 --> 00:20.137
<i>I've made sure</i>
<i>this call can't be intercepted.</i>

00:21.103 --> 00:22.237
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:22.737 --> 00:24.303
Who is this?

00:24.403 --> 00:26.070
<i>I can't tell you yet.</i>

00:26.437 --> 00:27.803
Yet?

00:27.903 --> 00:29.737
<i>You're headed for AUZA City, right?</i>

00:30.937 --> 00:34.003
<i>The city is protected</i>
<i>by a multilayered security system.</i>

00:34.637 --> 00:39.203
<i>It will be impossible to get past it</i>
<i>and find a way into the city alone.</i>

00:39.770 --> 00:40.770
<i>Let me help you.</i>

00:41.437 --> 00:43.770
You really think I would trust you?

00:44.437 --> 00:48.270
"Knowing others while not letting others
know you in the process

00:48.370 --> 00:51.070
is the true essence
of the art of the ninja."

00:52.370 --> 00:54.237
That verse... A ninja poem...

00:54.803 --> 00:57.303
<i>You and I are currently</i>
<i>in similar circumstances.</i>

00:58.237 --> 00:59.437
You're an exiled ninja?

00:59.570 --> 01:01.470
<i>If you wish to fulfill your objective,</i>

01:01.570 --> 01:04.437
<i>wait for my call at the location</i>
<i>I'm about to send you.</i>

01:04.537 --> 01:07.137
<i>Whether you should trust me or not</i>
<i>is up to you.</i>

02:53.303 --> 02:54.937
Aren't you gonna get that?

02:55.037 --> 02:58.770
It's just my wife. I need to focus
on the investigation right now.

02:58.870 --> 03:02.037
But we don't even know
if the eyewitness report is legit yet.

03:21.337 --> 03:23.370
They said the guy fell asleep
at the wheel.

03:25.270 --> 03:27.137
I've been calling you nonstop.

03:29.203 --> 03:31.203
I thought I could handle it...

03:32.303 --> 03:36.037
Marrying and having a family
with an FBI agent. But I was wrong!

03:55.837 --> 03:57.170
How are you feeling?

03:57.303 --> 04:01.270
Christ! You almost gave me
a heart attack! Damn it, Duck!

04:06.203 --> 04:08.037
So they claimed they want to help?

04:08.803 --> 04:12.303
How can you be sure they really are
another exiled ninja like you?

04:13.470 --> 04:17.003
They knew a poem that was only
passed down in the old organization.

04:17.103 --> 04:20.503
And nobody has spoken of it
since we came into this country.

04:20.603 --> 04:23.137
And that's enough to earn your trust?

04:23.203 --> 04:25.703
Either way, they know
what they're talking about.

04:25.803 --> 04:29.337
The complexity of the security system
at AUZA City is no joke.

04:29.437 --> 04:32.603
I'm pretty sure only, like,
a literal ghost could get past it.

04:32.670 --> 04:34.637
Fine, but what if it's a trap?

04:36.470 --> 04:37.603
Then I'll kill them.

04:37.670 --> 04:39.770
Don't just casually hint that to me!

04:39.837 --> 04:41.703
Remember our alliance is temporary.

04:44.503 --> 04:47.203
So, how do we get into the city?

04:47.303 --> 04:49.103
Considering my chat with the chief,

04:49.170 --> 04:51.537
they're probably keeping an eye
on me already.

04:51.637 --> 04:54.670
Yeah, no doubt about that.
We should just give up.

04:54.770 --> 04:55.970
Come on!

04:56.037 --> 05:00.737
You were the one who said the best way
to get a lead was to hit their HQ.

05:00.803 --> 05:02.370
And I agree with you on that.

05:02.470 --> 05:04.703
But I never said that was possible.

05:04.803 --> 05:06.803
Well, there's gotta be a way...

05:06.870 --> 05:08.637
Nope, can't be done.

05:09.670 --> 05:12.303
However, I've picked up on another lead.

05:13.103 --> 05:14.637
Really?

05:14.703 --> 05:19.470
This community in the dark web has been
keeping tabs on AUZA's actions.

05:19.537 --> 05:22.037
They claim AUZA is plotting
to take over the world

05:22.137 --> 05:24.470
and building
weapons of mass destruction.

05:24.537 --> 05:26.970
So another bunch
of loony conspiracy theorists.

05:27.037 --> 05:29.270
But why bother hiding it
on the dark web?

05:31.937 --> 05:33.737
Better safe than sorry, I guess.

05:34.470 --> 05:38.403
I’ve located the admin who claims
to be a former researcher at AUZA.

05:38.470 --> 05:39.570
Great.

05:39.637 --> 05:41.537
He's pretty far away from us, though.

05:41.603 --> 05:43.937
Not an issue. I'll be going alone.

05:44.537 --> 05:46.870
-What?
-You've done enough.

05:47.703 --> 05:51.270
This is a job for old-timers like myself
who have nothing left to lose.

05:52.937 --> 05:56.470
There's no way I'm letting you
have all the fun by yourself.

05:58.203 --> 06:01.370
We're on the verge of uncovering
AUZA's dirty secrets.

06:01.437 --> 06:04.703
With any luck, we might get our hands
on their cutting-edge data!

06:04.770 --> 06:06.570
That could be worth thousands!

06:06.637 --> 06:09.703
No! I would even say
it's worth millions of dollars!

06:10.137 --> 06:11.703
Seriously?

06:11.770 --> 06:14.470
That's the deal.
We're still in this together.

06:14.570 --> 06:16.037
Stay on your toes.

06:16.637 --> 06:18.437
Do you mind if I ask you something?

06:19.303 --> 06:22.237
Did your wife know what you really were
before she died?

06:22.303 --> 06:24.103
She did.

06:24.203 --> 06:26.270
Mari was also a ninja.

06:26.370 --> 06:28.737
Do ninjas normally have families?

06:29.203 --> 06:32.203
No. The two of us broke the code.

06:32.970 --> 06:34.437
What code?

06:34.770 --> 06:37.470
To be emotionally detached,
even from allies.

06:48.137 --> 06:49.137
I see...

06:49.937 --> 06:51.803
So you chose your family instead.

06:57.270 --> 06:58.800
Fantastic!

06:58.900 --> 07:00.740
He's quite the fighter, isn't he?

07:01.570 --> 07:04.400
Our data shows that just one
of those mass-produced units

07:04.470 --> 07:06.470
can destroy an entire army platoon,

07:06.570 --> 07:08.440
but even that wasn't a match for him!

07:08.540 --> 07:09.940
I know what you mean.

07:10.040 --> 07:12.900
You just can't wait
to finally screw the guy, right?

07:12.970 --> 07:15.770
No, please don't think me
as lowly as yourself.

07:17.140 --> 07:19.470
You see, I'm a businessman.

07:19.570 --> 07:22.140
I don't fight,
nor do I want any victories.

07:22.240 --> 07:23.800
I only care about the data!

07:23.940 --> 07:27.870
So what happens if he shows up?
You're just going to bend over?

07:27.940 --> 07:30.470
Well, that's why I have
my talented secretary here.

07:30.570 --> 07:32.400
-Isn't that right?
-Correct.

07:32.470 --> 07:36.240
Dilly, what kind of techniques
did he use to tame you like that?

07:36.300 --> 07:40.040
Sir, do I have permission
to share details of your techniques

07:40.100 --> 07:41.400
with this jackass?

07:41.970 --> 07:45.040
Let's not. Also, watch your language.

07:45.240 --> 07:46.870
My apologies, sir.

07:48.500 --> 07:52.170
So, does anybody have a plan?
You do realize he's headed here, right?

07:53.000 --> 07:54.900
No need for concern.

07:54.970 --> 07:57.400
The city's defenses
are 100% impenetrable.

07:57.970 --> 07:59.470
Wait! Hold on a sec!

07:59.570 --> 08:04.570
Aska, you can't just claim
something "is 100%" so casually.

08:04.970 --> 08:06.240
Probability is...

08:07.440 --> 08:09.070
Pardon me.

08:09.140 --> 08:11.240
Big D, are you listening?

08:11.940 --> 08:14.500
I gotta say, my hair is looking
super fly today.

08:15.270 --> 08:18.600
And if this ninja dares
to put one strand out of place...

08:19.300 --> 08:20.940
he's dead.

08:21.000 --> 08:23.600
Do you mean the hair
on your head or your...?

08:33.500 --> 08:35.300
Enough chit-chat.

08:37.740 --> 08:40.770
We already know that Higan is a force
to be reckoned with.

08:42.000 --> 08:43.840
So we're sticking to the plan.

08:44.600 --> 08:47.600
We must learn his technique
in order to eliminate him.

08:50.940 --> 08:52.440
What about his FBI friend?

08:53.000 --> 08:54.740
He is powerless.

08:55.300 --> 08:57.940
We can deal with him
if he ever becomes an issue.

08:58.400 --> 09:02.000
Don't make this any more complicated
than it needs to be.

09:02.800 --> 09:05.740
You're not my boss.
Do not order me around!

09:08.070 --> 09:10.440
<i>But I agree with your assessment.</i>

09:14.900 --> 09:16.040
<i>Dilly.</i>

09:16.770 --> 09:19.400
How far do you think
that ninja will get?

09:19.470 --> 09:20.940
Are you concerned?

09:21.300 --> 09:22.870
No, I'm excited!

09:23.200 --> 09:26.600
Why do you think I joined forces
with you guys in the first place?

09:27.440 --> 09:31.470
Fingers crossed we'll finally get
some decent data on the prototype now!

09:32.200 --> 09:34.370
I hope he doesn't die too quickly.

09:35.540 --> 09:38.940
Just say the word, and I'll end him
in the blink of an eye.

09:39.040 --> 09:40.570
You're not going anywhere.

09:41.070 --> 09:45.200
I'll just throw the others at Higan
until he has to reveal his technique.

09:45.570 --> 09:47.970
Their deaths wouldn't be
much of a loss anyway.

09:48.640 --> 09:51.070
And in any case,
it's only a matter of time

09:51.200 --> 09:52.740
till the suit is completed.

09:56.700 --> 09:59.100
<i>We ninjas are bound by the code,</i>

09:59.200 --> 10:02.900
<i>protected by the code,</i>
<i>and kept alive by the code!</i>

10:03.440 --> 10:07.070
<i>Therefore, it is our destiny</i>
<i>to die by the code!</i>

10:07.800 --> 10:10.870
<i>Our destiny is to die by the code!</i>

10:10.940 --> 10:14.570
<i>One: the secrets of the ninja</i>
<i>must never be divulged!</i>

10:14.640 --> 10:17.300
<i>The secrets of the ninja</i>
<i>must never be divulged!</i>

10:17.400 --> 10:19.600
<i>Two: Ninjas must be</i>
<i>emotionally detached,</i>

10:19.700 --> 10:21.100
<i>even from allies.</i>

10:21.240 --> 10:23.900
<i>Ninjas must be emotionally detached,</i>
<i>even from allies!</i>

10:23.970 --> 10:27.640
<i>Three: The mission must always</i>
<i>take precedent over your life!</i>

10:27.770 --> 10:30.570
<i>The mission must always</i>
<i>take precedent over your life!</i>

10:31.800 --> 10:33.170
Wait!

11:00.570 --> 11:03.770
As per tradition, all three of you
will now be given ninja names,

11:03.870 --> 11:06.740
in recognition
of your outstanding skills as shinobi.

11:07.300 --> 11:08.470
Higan.

11:08.800 --> 11:10.170
Zai.

11:10.300 --> 11:11.670
Mari.

11:11.800 --> 11:13.940
That is how you will be called
henceforth.

11:14.000 --> 11:15.170
Yes, sir.

11:15.270 --> 11:17.440
And that is not all
you will be receiving.

11:18.770 --> 11:21.600
A secret art shall be passed down
to each of you.

11:23.670 --> 11:26.270
You must keep this technique
to yourselves,

11:26.340 --> 11:28.240
and never share it with others.

11:29.470 --> 11:30.770
Is that clear?

11:30.840 --> 11:32.170
Yes, sir!

11:32.500 --> 11:36.100
Your missions from now on will be filled
with even greater dangers.

11:36.670 --> 11:38.670
However, the three of you are ninjas

11:38.770 --> 11:41.970
whose skills and strengths
are unmatched within our clan.

11:42.100 --> 11:44.270
I firmly believe you will be the ones

11:44.340 --> 11:46.740
who will lead our village
into the future.

11:52.600 --> 11:54.970
We have our own ninja names now.

11:55.070 --> 11:57.970
I liked them all.
They have a nice ring to them.

11:59.400 --> 12:00.570
"Higan."

12:01.670 --> 12:03.740
It will take some getting used to.

12:03.840 --> 12:05.900
Names are the proof that we exist.

12:05.970 --> 12:08.640
Now, we'll always be able
to remember each other.

12:08.770 --> 12:11.500
In that case, let's be honest
and share a moment of joy.

12:12.170 --> 12:14.170
Just don't share your secret art, now.

12:14.270 --> 12:18.400
Of course not. I'd be surprised
if we ever ended up fighting each other.

12:20.470 --> 12:24.740
If you ask me, our bond seems
thicker than blood.

12:26.300 --> 12:28.300
We never know when death will come.

12:28.770 --> 12:34.770
This is proof of our shared experiences,
of our hardships, and of our pact.

12:35.400 --> 12:36.770
What pact?

12:36.840 --> 12:40.240
That we'll risk our lives together,
to do what must be done.

14:21.740 --> 14:23.970
Just leave me behind.

14:25.570 --> 14:26.970
I won't.

14:43.270 --> 14:46.040
The mission will be a failure
at this rate!

14:46.900 --> 14:48.840
I'm not going back alone.

14:48.900 --> 14:50.400
Remember the code.

14:50.500 --> 14:53.000
We must be detached. Even from allies.

14:53.070 --> 14:54.740
From the moment I met you,

14:56.200 --> 14:58.240
I had already broken the code.

15:28.370 --> 15:29.870
You two okay?

15:51.970 --> 15:55.300
<i>Please leave your message</i>
<i>after the tone.</i>

15:56.540 --> 15:59.900
Jeez, Duck. You never pick up, do you?

16:00.800 --> 16:03.040
I'm on my way to the source now.

16:03.900 --> 16:05.500
I'll call you again later.

16:10.300 --> 16:11.300
Yeah?

16:11.370 --> 16:13.570
<i>Why didn't you report</i>
<i>you were discharged?</i>

16:13.670 --> 16:15.640
Nothing gets past this guy...

16:15.700 --> 16:18.400
You can just leave the get-well gift
on my desk, sir.

16:18.500 --> 16:20.740
I'll pick it up on retirement day.

16:20.840 --> 16:22.040
<i>You can do what you want</i>

16:22.140 --> 16:24.500
<i>since you're not assigned</i>
<i>to any investigations,</i>

16:24.570 --> 16:26.570
<i>but that does not apply</i>
<i>to your partner.</i>

16:29.170 --> 16:30.370
I'm sorry.

16:30.470 --> 16:31.800
Why are you apologizing?

16:31.870 --> 16:34.370
Following orders
is just part of the job.

16:34.470 --> 16:35.570
But I...

16:35.670 --> 16:39.800
To be honest, I've been racking my brain
trying to figure out how to ditch you.

16:39.870 --> 16:41.500
So don't worry about it.

16:42.800 --> 16:44.870
Say, are you feeling hungry at all?

16:46.240 --> 16:50.340
"No army fights on an empty stomach."
It's a Japanese proverb.

17:02.500 --> 17:03.970
<i>You made the right choice.</i>

17:04.040 --> 17:06.200
<i>-Now what?</i>
<i>-Don't be hasty.</i>

17:06.570 --> 17:10.340
<i>First, I need you to understand</i>
<i>how the city's security system works.</i>

17:10.400 --> 17:13.540
<i>All of AUZA City is guarded</i>
<i>by a security system comprising</i>

17:13.670 --> 17:16.840
<i>only their independently developed</i>
<i>technology.</i>

17:17.900 --> 17:20.240
<i>Sensors are equipped</i>
<i>along the entire perimeter</i>

17:20.370 --> 17:24.070
<i>to check if those approaching</i>
<i>have permission to enter the city.</i>

17:25.470 --> 17:29.200
<i>If any uninvited guests don't heed</i>
<i>the warnings issued,</i>

17:29.300 --> 17:31.370
<i>the system will go after them.</i>

17:33.240 --> 17:36.170
<i>Furthermore, the airspace</i>
<i>above the city is covered</i>

17:36.240 --> 17:38.840
<i>by a honeycomb-shaped</i>
<i>electromagnetic barrier,</i>

17:38.900 --> 17:41.340
<i>which only allows rain and wind</i>
<i>to pass through.</i>

17:42.240 --> 17:44.300
<i>Entering from above is impossible.</i>

17:46.200 --> 17:50.400
<i>So head to the underground facility</i>
<i>used to manage the security system.</i>

17:50.470 --> 17:52.800
<i>I will send you the coordinates</i>
<i>to the entrance</i>

17:52.900 --> 17:54.600
<i>and a map of the facility shortly.</i>

17:54.700 --> 17:58.200
<i>There are several security cameras</i>
<i>and laser traps inside the facility,</i>

17:58.300 --> 18:01.070
<i>as well as mercenaries</i>
<i>from private military companies</i>

18:01.200 --> 18:02.570
<i>guarding each section.</i>

18:03.200 --> 18:06.900
<i>Avoid any confrontation</i>
<i>in order for the plan to go smoothly.</i>

18:07.770 --> 18:11.270
<i>Once you make it past them, you'll get</i>
<i>to the electromagnetic barrier.</i>

18:11.370 --> 18:14.370
<i>I'll shut the power off</i>
<i>for five seconds when you arrive.</i>

18:14.900 --> 18:17.540
<i>Any longer and this won’t be</i>
<i>written off as an error.</i>

18:18.100 --> 18:21.200
<i>We'll start once the sun goes down.</i>
<i>You only get one chance.</i>

18:21.270 --> 18:22.700
<i>Just those five seconds.</i>

18:22.770 --> 18:23.770
No problem.

18:27.600 --> 18:29.270
<i>Now, that was tasty!</i>

18:30.370 --> 18:31.640
<i>I hope you got your fill.</i>

18:31.770 --> 18:33.900
Now I'm ready to fight whenever.

18:37.440 --> 18:40.370
Right, I'll send you a picture
of our target.

18:42.740 --> 18:44.400
Jason Cardenas.

18:44.470 --> 18:46.570
Hopefully, he hasn't changed too much.

18:46.800 --> 18:48.700
I'd still be able to tell.

18:49.200 --> 18:53.270
-Really? How, exactly?
-I'll teach you that at another time.

18:54.600 --> 18:56.800
Come to think of it,
this is the first time

18:56.900 --> 18:58.870
we'll be working apart from each other.

18:58.940 --> 19:00.570
You better pull your weight.

19:00.640 --> 19:02.400
Play it safe out there, Mike.

19:02.470 --> 19:05.270
You may not be the perfect mentor,
but I owe you a lot.

19:05.370 --> 19:07.270
Don't get all sappy on me now.

19:10.870 --> 19:13.040
-Another cup of joe!
-Again?

19:13.100 --> 19:15.140
You'll end up addicted to caffeine.

19:15.240 --> 19:18.440
What's with you?
Quit making it sound like I'm gonna die!

19:19.040 --> 19:21.440
It's just that I need you
in good health.

19:22.400 --> 19:24.970
Because I still have a lot
to learn from you.

19:25.440 --> 19:27.440
I hope you don't mind having me around!

19:30.300 --> 19:31.800
Actually, make it water.

19:43.870 --> 19:46.640
<i>I have hacked</i>
<i>all the internal surveillance cameras.</i>

19:46.740 --> 19:48.770
<i>We have eight minutes</i>
<i>before they notice.</i>

19:48.870 --> 19:50.370
<i>Finish before time's up.</i>

19:51.700 --> 19:52.870
I'm going in.

19:58.240 --> 20:01.540
<i>Patrol routes and inspection points</i>
<i>all follow a rigid schedule.</i>

20:02.400 --> 20:04.040
<i>Move exactly as I instruct you.</i>

20:11.740 --> 20:13.100
<i>Now.</i>

20:17.640 --> 20:19.470
<i>Head for the room across the hall.</i>

20:30.100 --> 20:32.940
<i>The laser trap ahead changes patterns</i>
<i>every two seconds.</i>

20:33.740 --> 20:36.740
<i>This is where you'll put</i>
<i>your physical prowess to the test.</i>

20:44.800 --> 20:48.170
Sensors have picked up an intruder
in Sector D! I repeat, Sector D!

20:53.870 --> 20:55.240
<i>Don't stop.</i>

21:03.370 --> 21:04.700
<i>Turn right.</i>

21:08.970 --> 21:11.540
<i>The way out is in the hallway</i>
<i>just ahead of you.</i>

21:11.600 --> 21:14.940
<i>Cutting the power.</i>
<i>The barrier will open for five seconds.</i>

21:25.300 --> 21:26.340
Zai.

21:27.640 --> 21:28.940
Higan.
